hadiths[112]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1541","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mimbar par baithe. Phir farmaya: Beshak ek banda hai jise Allah ne ikhtiyar diya ke use duniya ki raunaq mein se jo chahe de, ya jo Us ke paas hai. Phir us ne Us ke paas jo hai ikhtiyar kiya. Phir Abu Bakr roye. Aur farmaya: Hum tumhe apne baapon aur maaon se fida karte hain. Phir hum ne un par ta'ajjub kiya. Aur logon ne kaha: Is budhe ko dekho. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek bande ke bare mein khabar dete hain jise Allah ne ikhtiyar diya ke use duniya ki raunaq mein se de ya jo Us ke paas hai, jabke wo kehta hai: Hum tumhe apne baapon aur maaon se fida karte hain. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hi ikhtiyar diye gaye they. Aur Abu Bakr hum mein Aap ko sab se zyada jante they. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak apni sohbat aur maal mein mujh par ehsan karne walon mein se Abu Bakr hain. Aur agar main apni ummat mein se khalil banata to Abu Bakr ko banata, siwaye Islam ki dosti ke. Masjid mein Abu Bakr ki khidki ke siwa koi khidki baqi na rahe."
"1542","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe Dhat al-Salasil ke lashkar par bheja. Phir main Aap ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Logon mein tumhe sab se mehboob kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aisha. Phir main ne kaha: Mardon mein se? Aap ne farmaya: Un ke walid. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Phir Umar bin al-Khattab. Phir Aap ne mardon ko gina."
"1543","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi. Phir Aap ne unhe hukm diya ke wo Aap ki taraf lautein. Unhon ne kaha: Batayiye, agar main aaun aur tumhe na paun, goya wo kehtin: Maut? Aap (alaihissalam) ne farmaya: Agar tum mujhe na pao to Abu Bakr ke paas aao."
"1544","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Fajr ki namaz parhi. Phir logon ki taraf mutawajjah hue. Phir farmaya: Jab aadmi gaay hank raha tha jab wo us par sawar hua aur use mara. To us ne kaha: Beshak hum is liye paida nahi kiye gaye. Hum to kheti ke liye paida kiye gaye hain. Phir logon ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Gaay bolti hai? Phir Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main is par iman rakhta hun, main, Abu Bakr aur Umar, jabke wo dono wahan na they. Aur jab aadmi apni bakriyon mein tha jab bhediya dauda aur us mein se bakri le gaya. Phir talab kiya yahan tak ke goya use us se bachaya. Phir bhediye ne us se kaha: Ye, tum ne use mujh se bachaya. Phir us ke liye darindon ke din kaun hai, jis din us ka charwaha mere siwa koi nahi? Phir logon ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Bhediya bolta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Phir beshak main is par iman rakhta hun, main, Abu Bakr aur Umar, jabke wo dono wahan na they."
"1545","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali se Ibn Abbas ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar un ke bistar par rakhe gaye. Phir log unhe gher liye, dua karte aur namaz parhte, uthaye jane se pehle. Aur main un mein tha. Phir mujhe sirf ek shakhs ne daraya jo mera kandha pakde tha. Phir Ali they. Phir unhon ne Umar ke liye rehem ki dua ki. Aur farmaya: Tum ne ek ko nahi chhora jo mujhe tum se Allah se us ke amal jaisa milne se zyada mehboob ho. Allah ki qasam! Beshak main gumaan karta tha ke Allah tumhe tumhare dono sathiyon ke sath karega. Aur main samajhta tha ke main aksar Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate sunta tha: Main, Abu Bakr aur Umar gaye. Aur main, Abu Bakr aur Umar dakhil hue. Aur main, Abu Bakr aur Umar nikle."
"1546","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab main soya tha to main ne logon ko apne samne pesh kiye dekha, jabke un par qameesein thein. Un mein se kuchh seenon tak pahunchteen, kuchh is se neeche. Aur mere samne Umar bin al-Khattab pesh kiye gaye jabke un par qamees thi jo wo ghaseette. Unhon ne kaha: Phir tum ne is ki kya tabeer farmayi Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Deen."
"1547","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna, Aap ne farmaya: Jab main soya tha to mere paas doodh ka pyala laya gaya. Phir main ne piya yahan tak ke beshak main sairabi ko apne nakhunon mein nikalte dekhta hun. Phir main ne apna bacha hua Umar bin al-Khattab ko diya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir tum ne is ki kya tabeer farmayi Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Ilm."
"1548","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jab main soya tha to main ne apne aap ko kunwein par dekha jis par dol tha. Phir main ne us mein se jo Allah ne chaha nikala. Phir use Ibn Abi Quhafa ne liya. Phir us ne us se ek ya do dol nikale, jabke us ke nikalne mein kamzori thi. Aur Allah us ki kamzori ko bakhshے. Phir wo bada dol ban gaya. Phir use Ibn al-Khattab ne liya. Phir main ne logon mein danish-mand nahi dekha jo Umar ke nikalne jaisa nikalta ho, yahan tak ke logon ne hauz par oont bithaye."
"1549","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe khwab mein dikhaya gaya ke main kunwein par nausakhte dol se pani nikal raha hun. Phir Abu Bakr aaye. Phir unhon ne ek ya do dol kamzori se nikale. Allah unhe bakhshے. Phir Umar bin al-Khattab aaye. Phir wo bada dol ban gaya. Phir main ne danish-mand nahi dekha jo us ke kaatne jaisa kaate, yahan tak ke log sairab hue aur hauz par oont bithaye."
"1550","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main Jannat mein dakhil hua, ya Jannat ke paas aaya. Phir main ne mahal dekha. Phir main ne kaha: Ye kis ke liye hai? Unhon ne kaha: Umar bin al-Khattab ke liye. Phir main ne irada kiya ke us mein dakhil hun. Phir mujhe tumhari ghairat ke ilm ke siwa kuchh na roka. Umar bin al-Khattab ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mere maan-baap Aap par fida hon, ae Nabiullah! Kya main tum par ghairat karunga?"
"1551","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas they to Aap ne farmaya: Jab main soya tha to main ne apne aap ko Jannat mein dekha. Phir ek aurat mahal ke pehlu mein wuzu kar rahi thi. Phir main ne kaha: Ye mahal kis ke liye hai? To unhon ne kaha: Umar bin al-Khattab ke liye. Phir main ne us ki ghairat ko yaad kiya. Phir peeth pher kar phira. Phir Umar roye. Aur farmaya: Kya main tum par ghairat karunga Ya Rasulullah?"
"1552","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat mangi jabke Aap ke paas Quraish mein se aurtein thein jo Aap se baat karti thein aur Aap se zyada mangti thein, un ki awazein buland thein. Phir jab Umar ne ijazat mangi to wo parda ki taraf daudne khadi huein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe ijazat di, jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hans rahe they. Phir Umar ne kaha: Allah tumhare daant hansaye Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe in par ta'ajjub hua jo mere paas thein. Phir jab unhon ne tumhari awaz suni to parda ki taraf daud padein. Umar ne kaha: Phir tum Ya Rasulullah! Zyada haq-dar they ke wo darein. Phir kaha: Apni jaanon ki dushmanon! Kya tum mujh se darti ho aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se nahi darti? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zyada sakht aur sakht-mizaj ho. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Tumhe shaitan kabhi raste chalte nahi milta magar wo tumhare raste ke siwa raste chalta hai."
"1553","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Abdullah faut ho gaye to un ke bete Abdullah bin Abdullah Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Phir Aap se sawal kiya ke Aap use apni qamees dein jis mein wo apne walid ko kafan de. Phir Aap ne use di. Phir Aap se sawal kiya ke Aap us par namaz parhein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz parhne khade hue. Phir Umar khade hue aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka kapda pakda. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum us par namaz parhte ho jabke tumhare Rab ne tumhe us par namaz parhne se mana farmaya hai? Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne mujhe ikhtiyar diya. Phir farmaya [un ke liye maghfirat mango ya un ke liye maghfirat na mango. Agar tum un ke liye sattar martaba maghfirat mango]. Aur main sattar par izafa karunga. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak wo munafiq hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us par namaz parhi. Phir Allah ne ye nazil farmaya [aur un mein se jo mare us par kabhi namaz na parho, na us ki qabr par khade ho]."
"1554","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Madina ki deewaron mein se ek deewar mein tha. Phir ek shakhs aaya aur darwaza kholne ka sawal kiya. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us ke liye kholo aur use Jannat ki khush-khabri do. Phir main ne us ke liye khola. Phir wo Abu Bakr they. Phir main ne unhe us ki khush-khabri di jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya tha. Phir unhon ne Allah ki hamd ki. Phir ek shakhs aaya aur darwaza kholne ka sawal kiya. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us ke liye kholo aur use Jannat ki khush-khabri do. Phir main ne us ke liye khola. Phir wo Umar they. Phir main ne unhe us ki khabar di jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya tha. Phir unhon ne Allah ki hamd ki. Phir ek shakhs ne darwaza kholne ka sawal kiya. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Us ke liye kholo aur use Jannat ki khush-khabri do us museebat par jo use pahunchegi. Phir wo Usman they. Phir main ne unhe us ki khabar di jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya tha. Phir unhon ne Allah ki hamd ki. Phir farmaya: Allah se madad mangi jati hai."
"1555","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa al-Ash'ari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apne ghar mein wuzu farmaya. Phir nikle. Phir main ne kaha: Main zaroor Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se chipakunga aur aaj apne din Aap ke sath rahunga. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Wo masjid tashreef laye aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke bare mein poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Wo nikle aur yahan mutawajjah hue. Phir main Aap ke peechhe nikla aur Aap ke bare mein poochhta raha yahan tak ke Aap Bi'r Arees mein dakhil hue. Phir main darwaze ke paas baitha, jabke us ka darwaza khajoor ki tehniyon se tha, yahan tak ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni hajat poori farmayi aur wuzu farmaya. Phir main Aap ki taraf utha. Phir Wo Bi'r Arees par baithe they. Aur us ke kinare ke darmiyan baithe. Aur apni pindliyon se kapda uthaya aur unhe kunwein mein latkaya. Phir main ne Aap ko salam kiya. Phir phira aur darwaze ke paas baitha. Phir main ne kaha: Main aaj Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka darban rahunga. Phir Abu Bakr aaye aur darwaza hilaya. Phir main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr. Phir main ne kaha: Thehro. Phir gaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye Abu Bakr hain jo ijazat mangte hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Unhe ijazat do aur unhe Jannat ki khush-khabri do. Phir main aaya yahan tak ke main ne Abu Bakr se kaha: Dakhil ho jao. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumhe Jannat ki khush-khabri dete hain. Phir Abu Bakr dakhil hue. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke dayein Aap ke sath kinare mein baithe. Aur apne dono paon kunwein mein latkaye jaisa Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kiya tha. Aur apni pindliyon se kapda uthaya. Phir main lauta aur baitha, jabke main ne apne bhai ko chhora jo wuzu kar raha tha aur mujh se milne wala tha. Phir main ne kaha: Agar Allah falan se bhalayi chahe [apne bhai ka irada hai] to use lekar aaye. Phir insan darwaza hilata hua aaya. Phir main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To us ne kaha: Umar bin al-Khattab. Phir main ne kaha: Thehro. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko salam kiya. Phir main ne kaha: Ye Umar bin al-Khattab hain jo ijazat mangte hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Unhe ijazat do aur unhe Jannat ki khush-khabri do. Phir main aaya. Phir main ne kaha: Dakhil ho jao. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tumhe Jannat ki khush-khabri di hai. Phir wo dakhil hue. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath kinare mein Aap ke bayein baithe. Aur apne dono paon kunwein mein latkaye. Phir main lauta aur baitha. Phir main ne kaha: Agar Allah falan se bhalayi chahe to use lekar aaye. Phir insan darwaza hilata hua aaya. Phir main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To us ne kaha: Usman bin Affan. Phir main ne kaha: Thehro. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Unhe ijazat do aur unhe Jannat ki khush-khabri do us museebat par jo use pahunchegi. Phir main us ke paas aaya. Phir main ne us se kaha: Dakhil ho jao. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tumhe Jannat ki khush-khabri di hai us museebat par jo tumhe pahunchegi. Phir wo dakhil hue. Phir kinara bhara hua paya. Phir doosre kinare se samne baithe. Sa'id bin al-Musayyab ne kaha [Abu Musa se hadith ke rawi]: Phir main ne un ki tabeer un ki qabron se ki."
"1556","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Tabuk ki taraf nikle aur Ali ko khalifa banaya. To unhon ne kaha: Kya tum mujhe bachchon aur aurton mein khalifa banate ho? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi nahi ke tum mujh se Musa se Haroon ke darje par ho, magar mere baad Nabi nahi?"
"1557","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Khaibar ke din farmate suna: Main zaroor jhande ko us shakhs ko dunga jis ke hathon par Allah fatah dega. Phir wo khade hue is ki ummeed mein ke un mein se kise diya jayega? Phir wo subah aaye jabke sab ummeed rakhte they ke diya jayega. To Aap ne farmaya: Ali kahan hain? Kaha gaya: Un ki aankhon mein dard hai. Phir Aap ne hukm diya. Phir wo un ke liye bulaye gaye. Phir Aap ne un ki dono aankhon mein thooka. Phir wo usi jagah theek ho gaye yahan tak ke goya unhe kuchh na tha. Phir unhon ne kaha: Hum un se ladenge yahan tak ke wo hamare jaisa hon. To Aap ne farmaya: Narmi se, yahan tak ke un ke maidan mein utro. Phir unhe Islam ki taraf bulao. Aur unhe khabar do jo un par wajib hai. Phir Allah ki qasam! Tumhare zariye ek shakhs ko hidayat milna tumhare liye surkh oonton se behtar hai."
"1558","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali (raziyallahu anhu) Khaibar mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se peechhe reh gaye they, jabke unhe aashob-e-chashm tha. Phir unhon ne kaha: Kya main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se peechhe rahunga? Phir Ali nikle aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mile. Phir jab us raat ki shaam thi jis ki subah mein fatah hui to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main zaroor jhande ko dunga, ya farmaya: Kal wo shakhs zaroor lega jise Allah aur Us ke Rasool mehboob rakhte hain, ya farmaya: Jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool se mohabbat karta hai. Allah us par fatah dega. Phir hum Ali se they jabke hum un ki ummeed na rakhte they. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ye Ali hain. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe diya. Phir Allah ne un par fatah di."
"1559","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fatima ke ghar tashreef laye. Phir Aap ne Ali ko ghar mein na paya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare chacha-zaad kahan hain? Unhon ne kaha: Mere aur us ke darmiyan kuchh tha. Phir us ne mujhe ghussa dilaya. Phir wo nikla aur mere paas dopahar aaram na kiya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne insan se farmaya: Dekho wo kahan hai? Phir wo aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Wo masjid mein so rahe hain. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye jabke Wo lete they. Aap ki chadar Aap ke pehlu se gir gayi thi aur Aap ko mitti lagi thi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) use Aap se ponchhne lage. Aur farmate: Utho ae Abu Turab! Utho ae Abu Turab!"
"1560","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) raat mein jage. Phir jab Aap Madina tashreef laye to farmaya: Kash mere sahaba mein se nek mard aaj raat meri hifazat kare? Jab hum ne hathyar ki awaz suni to Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? To us ne kaha: Main Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas hun. Aap ki hifazat ke liye aaya hun. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) so gaye."
"1561","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Sa'd ke baad kisi mard par fidya karte nahi dekha. Main ne Aap ko farmate suna: Teer maro. Mere maan-baap tum par fida hon."
"1562","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Uhud ke din mere liye apne walidain jama kiye."
"1563","[AI-translation] Hazrat Talha aur Sa'd se Abu Usman ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Un dino mein se kuchh mein jin mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) lade, Aap ke sath Talha aur Sa'd ke siwa koi baqi na raha, un dono ki hadith se."
"1564","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kaun Ahzab ke din qaum ki khabar mere paas layega? Zubair ne kaha: Main. Phir farmaya: Kaun qaum ki khabar mere paas layega? Zubair ne kaha: Main. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak har Nabi ka hawari hota hai. Aur Zubair mere hawari hain."
"1565","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zubair se Abdullah bin al-Zubair ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ahzab ke din tha. Mujhe aur Umar bin Abi Salama ko aurton mein rakha gaya tha. Phir main ne dekha to main Zubair ko apne ghode par dekhta tha, jo Bani Quraiza ki taraf aate-jate they, do ya teen martaba. Phir jab main lauta to main ne kaha: Ae abba-jaan! Main ne tumhe aate-jate dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne mujhe dekha ae mere bete? Main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya tha: Kaun Bani Quraiza ke paas jaye aur un ki khabar mere paas laye? Phir main chala. Phir jab main lauta to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mere liye apne walidain jama kiye. Phir farmaya: Mere maan-baap tum par fida hon."
"1566","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak har ummat ka ameen hota hai. Aur beshak hamare ameen, ae ummat! Abu Ubaida bin al-Jarrah hain."
"1567","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Najran walon se farmaya: Main zaroor bhejungا, matlab tum par, matlab haq ameen. Phir Aap ke sahaba ne gardan uthayi. Phir Aap ne Abu Ubaida (raziyallahu anhu) ko bheja."
"1568","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah al-Dausi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) din ke ek hisse mein nikle. Na mujh se kalam karte they na main Aap se kalam karta tha. Yahan tak ke Aap Bani Qainuqa ke bazar aaye. Phir Fatima ke ghar ke sehan mein baithe. Phir farmaya: Kya chhota hai? Kya chhota hai? Phir use kuchh ne rok liya. Phir main ne gumaan kiya ke wo use haar pehna rahi hain ya use ghusl de rahi hain. Phir wo daudta hua aaya yahan tak ke us ne Aap ko gale lagaya aur bosa diya. Aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Us se mohabbat farma aur jo us se mohabbat kare us se mohabbat farma."
"1569","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha jabke Hasan Aap ke kandhe par they. Aap farmate: Ae Allah! Beshak main us se mohabbat karta hun. Phir Tu us se mohabbat farma."
"1570","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Zaid bin Haritha, jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke aazad-karda they, hum unhe Zaid bin Muhammad ke siwa na kehte they yahan tak ke Quran nazil hua [unhe un ke baapon se pukaro. Ye Allah ke nazdeek zyada insaf hai]."
"1571","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne lashkar bheja aur un par Usama bin Zaid ko ameer banaya. Phir kuchh logon ne us ki imarat mein ta'an kiya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum us ki imarat mein ta'an karte ho to beshak tum us se pehle us ke walid ki imarat mein ta'an karte they. Allah ki qasam! Beshak wo imarat ke laiq tha. Aur beshak wo logon mein mujhe sab se mehboob tha. Aur beshak ye us ke baad logon mein mujhe sab se mehboob hai."
"1572","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Ja'far (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, Ibn al-Zubair ne Ibn Ja'far (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha: Kya tumhe yaad hai jab hum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka istiqbal kiya, main, tum aur Ibn Abbas? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Phir Aap ne hamein sawar kiya aur tumhe chhora."
"1573","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Un ki aurton mein behtar Maryam bint Imran hain. Aur un ki aurton mein behtar Khadija hain."
"1574","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mardon mein se bahut kamil hue. Aur aurton mein se siwaye Firaun ki biwi Asiya aur Maryam bint Imran ke koi kamil nahi hui. Aur beshak Aisha ki fazilat aurton par aisi hai jaise sareed ki fazilat tamam khane par."
"1575","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jibreel Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye Khadija hain jo aayi hain, un ke paas bartan hai jis mein saalan, khana ya sharbat hai. Phir jab wo tumhare paas aayein to unhe un ke Rab ki taraf se aur meri taraf se salam kaho. Aur unhe Jannat mein naalon se bane ghar ki khush-khabri do, jis mein shor nahi na thakan."
"1576","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se Ismail ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khadija ko khush-khabri di? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Naalon se bane ghar ki, jis mein shor nahi na thakan."
"1577","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon mein se kisi par itni ghairat nahi karti thi jitni Khadija par karti thi. Aur main ne unhe nahi dekha. Lekin Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ka kasrat se zikr farmate. Aur kabhi bakri zibah farmate phir use tukde tukde karte. Phir use Khadija ki saheliyon mein bhejte. Phir kabhi main Aap se kehti: Goya duniya mein Khadija ke siwa aurat hi na thi? To Aap farmate: Beshak wo aisi thein, aisi thein. Aur mujhe un se aulad hui."
"1578","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Khadija ki behan Hala bint Khuwailid ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat mangi. Phir Aap ne Khadija ke ijazat mangne ko pehchana. Phir Aap ghabra gaye. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Hala. Unhon ne kaha: Phir mujhe ghairat aayi. Phir main ne kaha: Tum Quraish ki budhiyon mein se ek budhiya ko kyun yaad karte ho, surkh jabdon wali, jo zamane mein halak ho gayi? Beshak Allah ne tumhe us se behtar de di hai."
"1579","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum mujhe khwab mein do martaba dikhayi gayein. Main dekhta hun ke tum reshmi kapde mein ho. Aur Wo farmate: Ye tumhari biwi hain. Phir us se kholo. Phir wo tum hotin. Phir main kehta hun: Agar ye Allah ki taraf se ho to Wo use poora karega."
"1580","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Beshak main janta hun jab tum mujh se raazi hoti ho, jab tum mujh par ghazab-naak hoti ho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne kaha: Tum ye kahan se jante ho? To Aap ne farmaya: Raha jab tum mujh se raazi hoti ho to tum kehti ho: Nahi, Muhammad ke Rab ki qasam! Aur jab tum ghazab-naak hoti ho to kehti ho: Nahi, Ibrahim ke Rab ki qasam! Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Haan, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Main tumhare naam ke siwa nahi chhorti."
"1581","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gudiyon se khelti thi. Aur meri saheliyan thein jo mere sath khelti thein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab dakhil hote to wo Aap se chhup jatin. Phir Wo unhe meri taraf bhejte. Phir wo mere sath khelti thein."
"1582","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke log Aisha ke din apne hadiye ka khayal rakhte, us se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki khushi chahte."
"1583","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni us bimari mein poochhte jis mein Aap ki wafat hui, farmate: Main kal kahan hun? Main kal kahan hun? Aisha ka irada hai. Phir Aap ki biwiyon ne Aap ko ijazat di ke Wo jahan chahein hon. Phir Wo Aisha ke ghar mein they yahan tak ke un ke paas wafat pa gaye. Aisha ne kaha: Phir Wo us din faut hue jis din Wo meri bari mein mere paas aate they, mere ghar mein. Phir Allah ne Aap ko qabz farmaya jabke Aap ka sar meri gardan aur seene ke darmiyan tha."
"1584","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko suna, Aap ki taraf kaan lagaye Aap ke faut hone se pehle, jabke Wo mujh se tek lagaye apni peeth farmate: Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par rehem farma, mujhe Rafeeq se mila de."
"1585","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main sunti thi ke Nabi faut nahi hota yahan tak ke use duniya aur Aakhirat ke darmiyan ikhtiyar diya jaye. Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apni us bimari mein farmate suna jis mein Aap ki wafat hui, jabke Aap ko gale mein kharash thi, farmate: [Un ke sath jin par Allah ne inaam farmaya] ayat tak. Phir main ne gumaan kiya ke Aap ko ikhtiyar diya gaya."
"1586","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tandurust hote hue farmate: Beshak Nabi kabhi qabz nahi kiya jata yahan tak ke Jannat mein apni jagah dekhe. Phir use zinda rakha jaye ya ikhtiyar diya jaye. Phir jab Aap beemar hue aur Aap par qabz ka waqt aaya, jabke Aap ka sar Aisha ki raan par tha, Aap par behoshi tari hui. Phir jab Aap hosh mein aaye to Aap ki nazar ghar ki chhat ki taraf uthi. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Rafeeq A'la mein. Phir main ne kaha: Phir Wo hamara padosi nahi honge. Phir main ne pehchana ke wo Aap ki hadith hai jo Wo hamein bayan farmate they jabke Wo tandurust they."
"1587","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab nikalte to apni biwiyon ke darmiyan qura-andazi farmate. Phir qura Aisha aur Hafsa ke liye nikla. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab raat mein hote to Aisha ke sath chalte baat karte. Phir Hafsa ne kaha: Kya tum aaj raat mere oont par sawar nahi hogin aur main tumhare oont par sawar hunga? Tum dekho aur main dekhun? To unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Phir wo sawar huein. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Aisha ke oont ke paas aaye jabke us par Hafsa thein. Phir unhe salam kiya. Phir chalte rahe yahan tak ke utre. Aur Aisha ne Aap ko gum paya. Phir jab utre to unhon ne apne dono paon izkhir ke darmiyan kiye. Aur kehtin: Ae mere Rab! Mujh par bichchhu ya saanp musallat farma jo mujhe kaate. Aur main us se kuchh keh nahi sakti."
"1588","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Aisha ki fazilat aurton par aisi hai jaise sareed ki fazilat khane par."
"1589","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Ae Aisha! Ye Jibreel hain jo tumhe salam kehte hain. To unhon ne kaha: Un par salam, Allah ki rehmat aur barkatein. Tum dekhte ho jo main nahi dekhti. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka irada hai."
"1590","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Gyarah aurtein baithein. Phir unhon ne ahad kiya aur muahida kiya ke wo apne shoharon ki khabaron mein se kuchh nahi chhupayengi. Pehli ne kaha: Mera shohar dubli oontni ka gosht hai, pahad ke sar par. Na aasan ke chadha jaye, na mote ke muntaqil kiya jaye. Doosri ne kaha: Main apne shohar ki khabar nahi kholti. Beshak main darti hun ke use nahi chhorungi. Agar use zikr karun to us ke aib zikr karun. Teesri ne kaha: Mera shohar lamba bewaqoof hai. Agar bolun to talaq di jayun. Agar khamosh rahun to latki rahun. Chauthi ne kaha: Mera shohar Tihama ki raat jaisa hai. Na garmi na sardi, na dar na uktahat. Panchwen ne kaha: Mera shohar, agar dakhil ho to cheeta, agar nikle to sher. Aur jo us ne dekha us ke bare mein nahi poochhta. Chhati ne kaha: Mera shohar, agar khaye to lapete. Agar piye to nichod le. Agar lete to simat jaye. Aur hatheli dakhil nahi karta taake gham jane. Saatwen ne kaha: Mera shohar kam-aql ya na-mard, band, har beemari us ki beemari hai. Tumhara sar phaade ya tode, ya tumhare liye sab jama kare. Aathwen ne kaha: Mera shohar, chhuna khargosh ka chhuna, khushboo zar nab ki khushboo. Naueen ne kaha: Mera shohar unche sutun wala, lambi talwar wala, badi raakh wala, majlis se ghar qareeb. Duswen ne kaha: Mera shohar Malik. Aur Malik kya hai? Malik is se behtar hai. Us ke paas oont hain jo thaharne mein bahut, charne mein kam. Aur jab wo mizmar ki awaz sunte hain to yaqeen karte hain ke wo halak hone wali hain. Gyarhween ne kaha: Mera shohar Abu Zar'. Phir Abu Zar' kya hai? Us ne mere kaanon ko zewar se bhari kiya. Aur mere bazoun ko charbi se bhara. Aur mujhe fakhr dilaya. Phir main apne aap par fakhr karne lagi. Us ne mujhe bakriyon walon mein paya, mushkil mein. Phir us ne mujhe ghodon, oonton, kheti aur safayi walon mein rakha. Phir us ke paas main kehti to buri nahi kehti. Aur soti to subah tak soti. Aur peeti to sairab hoti. Abu Zar' ki maan, phir Abu Zar' ki maan kya hai? Us ke bartan bhare hue, us ka ghar kushada. Abu Zar' ka beta, phir Abu Zar' ka beta kya hai? Us ka bistar talwar ki myan jaisa. Aur use bakri ke bache ki raan sairab karti hai. Abu Zar' ki beti, phir Abu Zar' ki beti kya hai? Apne baap ki itaat-guzar, apni maan ki itaat-guzar. Apne kapde ko bharne wali, apni padosan ko ghussa dilane wali. Abu Zar' ki londi, phir Abu Zar' ki londi kya hai? Wo hamari baat nahi pheelati. Na hamare toshe ko kam karti hai. Na hamare ghar ko kachre se bharti hai. Unhon ne kaha: Abu Zar' nikla jab mashkeeze biloye ja rahe they. Phir wo us aurat se mila jis ke sath us ke do bete cheeton jaisa they. Wo us ki kamar ke neeche do anaron se khelte they. Phir us ne mujhe talaq di aur us se nikah kiya. Phir main ne us ke baad shareef mard se nikah kiya. Wo tez ghode par sawar hua. Aur khatti neza liya. Aur mujh par bahut se maweshi lauta kar laya. Aur mujhe har aane wali mein se joda diya. Aur kaha: Khayiye, Umm Zar'! Aur apne ghar walon ko khilayiye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir agar main wo sab jama karun jo us ne mujhe diya, wo Abu Zar' ke sab se chhote bartan ko nahi pahunchega. Aisha ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main tumhare liye Abu Zar' jaisa hun Umm Zar' ke liye."
"1591","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miswar bin Makhrama se Ibn Shihab ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Ali bin Husain ne unhe bayan kiya ke wo jab Madina aaye, Yazid bin Muawiya ke paas se, Husain bin Ali ke qatl ke baad, Allah ki rehmat un par, to Miswar bin Makhrama un se mile. Phir unhon ne un se kaha: Kya tumhe meri taraf hajat hai jo tum mujhe hukm do? Phir main ne un se kaha: Nahi. Phir unhon ne un se kaha: Kya tum mujhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki talwar doge? Kyunke mujhe dar hai ke qaum tum par ghalba payegi. Allah ki qasam! Agar tum ne mujhe di to unhe kabhi nahi pahunchnegi yahan tak ke meri jaan nikal jaye. Beshak Ali bin Abi Talib ne Abu Jahl ki beti ka Fatima (alaihassalam) par paigham bheja. Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko logon ko is mein apne is mimbar par khutba dete suna, jabke main us din baligh tha. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Fatima mujh se hai. Aur main darta hun ke wo apne deen mein aazmayi jaye. Phir Bani Abd Shams mein se apne damaad ka zikr kiya. Phir us ke Aap se rishtedari par us ki tareef ki. Unhon ne kaha: Us ne mujh se bayan kiya aur sach kaha. Aur mujh se wada kiya aur wafa kiya. Aur beshak main halal ko haram nahi karta, na haram ko halal karta hun. Lekin, Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki beti aur Allah ke dushman ki beti kabhi jama nahi hongi."
"1592","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miswar bin Makhrama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Ali ne Abu Jahl ki beti ka paigham bheja. Phir Fatima ne isے suna. Phir wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayein. Phir unhon ne kaha: Tumhari qaum dawa karti hai ke tum apni betiyon ke liye ghussa nahi karte. Aur ye Ali Abu Jahl ki beti se nikah kar raha hai. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue. Phir main ne Aap ko suna jab Aap ne shahadat parhi, farmate: Amma ba'd! Main ne Abu al-Aas bin al-Rabi se nikah kiya. Phir us ne mujh se bayan kiya aur sach kaha. Aur beshak Fatima mera tukda hai. Aur beshak main na-pasand karta hun ke use bura lage. Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki beti aur Allah ke dushman ki beti ek mard ke paas kabhi jama nahi hongi. Phir Ali ne paigham chhor diya."
"1593","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha aur Fatima (alaihassalam) se Aisha Umm al-Muminin ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak hum, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyan, Aap ke paas sab jama thein, hum mein se ek bhi gayi na thi. Phir Fatima (alaihassalam) chalti huein aayein. Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Un ki chaal Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki chaal se chhupi na thi. Phir jab Aap ne unhe dekha to khush-aamdeed kaha. Unhon ne kaha: Meri beti ko khush-aamdeed. Phir unhe apne dayein ya bayein bithaya. Phir un se sargoshi ki. Phir wo sakht royein. Phir jab Aap ne un ka gham dekha to doosri martaba un se sargoshi ki. Phir wo hansein. Phir main ne un se kaha, main un ki biwiyon mein se: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tumhe hum mein se raaz se khaas kiya. Phir tum roti ho? Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue to main ne un se poochha: Aap ne tum se kya sargoshi ki? Unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka raaz faash karne wali na thi. Phir jab wafat ho gayi to main ne un se kaha: Main tumhe qasam deti hun jo mera tum par haq hai ke tum ne mujhe khabar di. Unhon ne kaha: Raha ab, haan. Phir unhon ne mujhe khabar di. Unhon ne kaha: Raha jab Aap ne mujh se pehle mamle mein sargoshi ki, Aap ne mujhe khabar di: Ke Jibreel har saal Quran ka mujh se ek martaba daur karte they. Aur unhon ne mujh se is saal do martaba daur kiya hai. Aur main muddat ke siwa nahi dekhta ke qareeb aa gayi hai. Phir Allah se daro aur sabr karo. Kyunke main tumhare liye kya hi acha aage jane wala hun. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main wo roi jo tum ne dekha. Phir jab Aap ne meri be-qarari dekhi to doosri martaba mujh se sargoshi ki. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Fatima! Kya tum raazi nahi ke tum momin aurton ki sardar ho, ya is ummat ki aurton ki sardar ho?"
"1594","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Jibreel (alaihissalam) Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye jabke Aap ke paas Umm Salama thein. Phir baat karne lage. Phir khade hue. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Umm Salama se farmaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Ye Dihya hain. Umm Salama ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main use wahi samajhti rahi yahan tak ke main ne Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka khutba suna jis mein Aap Jibreel ki khabar dete they."
"1595","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki kuchh biwiyon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha: Hum mein se tum se milne mein sab se jaldi kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein sab se lambe hath wali. Phir unhon ne nalki li aur use napne lage. Phir Sauda un mein sab se lambe hath wali thein. Phir hum ne baad mein jana ke un ke hath ki lambayi sadqa thi. Aur wo hum mein Aap se milne mein sab se jaldi thein. Aur wo sadqa pasand karti thein."
"1596","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina mein ghar mein dakhil na hote, siwaye Umm Sulaim ke ghar ke, Aap ki biwiyon ke siwa. Phir Aap se kaha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main us par rehem karta hun. Us ka bhai mere sath qatl hua."
"1597","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa al-Ash'ari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur mera bhai Yemen se aaye. Phir hum kuchh arsa thehre. Hum Abdullah bin Mas'ud ko Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ghar walon mein se ek mard ke siwa na samajhte they, us se jo hum dekhte they ke wo aur un ki walida Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dakhil hote."
"1598","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) ne khutba diya. Phir farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke munh se sattar se kuchh zyada surtein leen. Allah ki qasam! Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba jante they ke main un mein Allah ki kitab ko sab se zyada janta hun. Aur main un mein sab se behtar nahi hun. Shaqiq ne kaha [hadith ke rawi]: Phir main halqon mein baitha sunta hun jo wo kehte hain. Phir main ne kisi jawab ko is ke siwa kehte nahi suna."
"1599","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi! Allah ki kitab mein se koi surat nazil nahi hui magar main janta hun wo kahan nazil hui. Na Allah ki kitab mein se koi ayat nazil hui magar main janta hun wo kis mein nazil hui. Aur agar main kisi ko mujh se Allah ki kitab ko zyada jante hue janun jise oont pahuncha sakte hon to main us ki taraf sawar hun."
"1600","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr se Masrooq ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ka Abdullah bin Amr ke paas zikr hua. To unhon ne kaha: Wo shakhs hai jis se main hamesha mohabbat karunga, us ke baad jo main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Chaar se Quran parho: Abdullah Mas'ud se [Aap ne us se ibtida farmayi], Salim maula Abi Huzaifa se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, Muadh bin Jabal se."
"1601","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein Quran chaar ne jama kiya. Sab Ansar mein se they: Ubayy, Muadh bin Jabal, Abu Zaid aur Zaid bin Thabit."
"1602","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ubayy se farmaya: Beshak Allah ne mujhe hukm farmaya hai ke tumhe [lam yakun] parh kar sunaun. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ne mera naam liya? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Phir wo roye."
"1603","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Sa'd bin Muadh ki maut se Arsh hil gaya."
"1604","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko reshmi joda hadiya kiya gaya. Phir Aap ke sahaba use chhune lage aur us ki narmi par ta'ajjub karne lage. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum is ki narmi par ta'ajjub karte ho? Sa'd bin Muadh ke rumal is se behtar hain, ya narm."
"1605","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sundus ka jubba hadiya kiya gaya, jabke Wo reshmi se manع farmate. Phir log us par ta'ajjub karne lage. To Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Jannat mein Sa'd bin Muadh ke rumal is se behtar hain."
"1606","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Uhud ke din mere walid laye gaye jabke un ka musla kiya gaya tha, yahan tak ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke samne rakhe gaye. Aur unhe kapda odhaya gaya tha. Phir main ne irada kiya ke un se kholun. Phir meri qaum ne mujhe mana kiya. Phir main ne irada kiya ke un se kholun. Phir meri qaum ne mujhe mana kiya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hukm diya. Phir uthaya gaya. Phir cheekhne wali ki awaz suni. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? To unhon ne kaha: Amr ki beti ya Amr ki behan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir tum kyun roti ho ya na ro? Phir farishte use apne paron se saya karte rahe yahan tak ke uthaya gaya."
"1607","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Abu Dharr ko Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke bheje jane ki khabar pahunchi to unhon ne apne bhai se kaha: Is wadi ki taraf sawar ho. Phir mere liye is shakhs ka ilm maloom karo jo dawa karta hai ke wo Nabi hai jis ke paas aasman se khabar aati hai. Aur us ke qaul mein se suno. Phir mere paas aao. Phir bhai chala yahan tak ke Aap ke paas aaya. Aur Aap ke qaul mein se suna. Phir Abu Dharr ki taraf lauta. Phir us se kaha: Main ne use makarim akhlaq ka hukm dete dekha. Aur kalam, jo sher nahi hai. To us ne kaha: Tum ne mujhe us se shifa nahi di jo main chahta tha. Phir tosha liya aur apni mashkeeza uthayi jis mein pani tha, yahan tak ke Makkah aaya. Phir masjid aaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko talash kiya. Aur Aap ko na pehchana. Aur Aap ke bare mein poochhne ko na-pasand kiya. Yahan tak ke use raat ka kuchh hissa paya. Phir use Ali ne dekha. Phir pehchana ke wo ajnabi hai. Phir jab us ne use dekha to us ke peechhe chala. Phir un dono mein se ek ne sathi se kisi cheez ke bare mein na poochha yahan tak ke subah hui. Phir apni mashkeeza aur tosha masjid ki taraf uthaya. Aur us din raha. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) use na dekhte yahan tak ke shaam hui. Phir apne sone ki jagah lauta. Phir us ke paas se Ali guzre. Phir unhon ne kaha: Kya mard ke liye nahi hua ke wo apna maskan jane? Phir use thahraya. Phir use apne sath le gaye. Un dono mein se ek ne sathi se kisi cheez ke bare mein na poochha. Yahan tak ke jab teesra din tha to Ali is jaisa laute. Phir us ke sath thehre. Phir kaha: Kya tum mujhe bayan nahi karoge ke tumhe kis ne layi? Us ne kaha: Agar tum mujhe ahad aur paiman do ke tum mujhe hidayat doge to karunga. Phir Aap ne kiya. Phir usے khabar di. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak Wo haq hain. Aur Wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hain. Phir jab subah ho to mere peechhe aao. Phir beshak agar main koi cheez dekhun jis se mujhe tum par dar ho to main khada hunga goya main pani bahata hun. Phir agar main chalun to mere peechhe aao yahan tak ke mere dakhil hone mein dakhil ho. Phir Aap ne kiya. Phir Aap ke peechhe chale yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dakhil hue. Aur Aap ke sath dakhil hue. Phir Aap ke qaul mein se suna. Aur usi jagah musalman hue. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Apni qaum ki taraf lauto aur unhe khabar do yahan tak ke tumhare paas mera hukm aaye. Unhon ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Main un ke darmiyan zaroor cheekhunga. Phir nikla yahan tak ke masjid aaya. Phir buland awaz se pukara: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi. Aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain. Phir qaum khadi hui aur use mara yahan tak ke use lita diya. Aur Abbas aaye. Phir us par jhuke. Unhon ne kaha: Tum par afsos! Kya tum nahi jante ke wo Ghifar mein se hai? Aur tumhari tijarat ka rasta Sham ki taraf hai? Phir unhon ne un se use bachaya. Phir agle din is jaisi ke liye laute. Phir unhon ne use mara. Aur us ki taraf toote. Phir Abbas us par jhuke."
"1608","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se jab se main musalman hua parda nahi farmaya. Na mujhe dekha magar mere chehre mein muskuraye. Aur beshak main ne Aap se shikayat ki ke main ghodon par sabit nahi rehta. Phir Aap ne apne hath se mere seene par mara. Aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Use sabit rakh. Aur use hidayat dene wala hidayat lene wala bana."
"1609","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tum mujhe Dhu al-Khalasa se aaram nahi doge? Aur wo Khath'am mein ghar tha jise Ka'bat al-Yamaniya kaha jata hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main dedh sau sawar mein chala jo Ahmas mein se they. Aur wo ghodon wale they. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main ghodon par sabit na rehta tha. Phir Aap ne mere seene par mara yahan tak ke main ne Aap ki ungliyon ka nishan apne seene mein dekha. Aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Use sabit rakh. Aur use hidayat dene wala hidayat lene wala bana. Phir wo us ki taraf chale. Phir use toda aur jalaya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf bheja taake Aap ko khabar de. Phir Jarir ke qasid ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne tumhe haq ke sath bheja! Main tumhare paas nahi aaya yahan tak ke use khokhle ya khujli wale oont jaisa chhora. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne Ahmas ke ghodon aur mardon mein barkat di, paanch martaba."
"1610","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bait al-khala mein dakhil hue. Phir main ne Aap ke liye wuzu rakha. Unhon ne kaha: Ye kis ne rakha? Phir Aap ko khabar di gayi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Use deen mein samajh de."
"1611","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aadmi Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zindagi mein jab khwab dekhta to use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bayan karta. Phir main ne tamanna ki ke khwab dekhun aur use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bayan karun. Aur main naujawan ladka tha. Aur main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein masjid mein sota tha. Phir main ne neend mein dekha goya do farishte mujhe pakde. Phir mujhe Aag ki taraf le gaye. Phir wo kunwein ke modne jaisi modi hui thi. Jab us ke do kinare they. Jab us mein log they jinhe main ne pehchana. Phir main kehne laga: Main Aag se Allah ki panah mangta hun. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum se doosra farishta mila. Phir us ne mujh se kaha: Tumhe dar nahi. Phir main ne use Hafsa ko bayan kiya. Phir Hafsa ne use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bayan kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Abdullah kya hi acha mard hai agar wo raat mein namaz parhta! Phir Wo is ke baad raat mein thodi ke siwa na sote."
"1612","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Umm Sulaim ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Anas tumhara khadim hai. Allah se us ke liye dua farmayiye. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Us ka maal aur aulad zyada farma. Aur use us mein barkat de jo Tune use diya."
"1613","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se poshida baat farmayi. Phir main ne us ke baad usے kisi ko khabar na di. Aur mujh se Umm Sulaim ne poochha. Phir main ne unhe us ki khabar na di."
"1614","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kisi ko kehte nahi suna jo zameen par chalta ho ke wo Jannat walon mein se hai, siwaye Abdullah bin Salam ke. Unhon ne kaha: Aur us mein ye ayat nazil hui [aur Bani Israil mein se gawah ne gawahi di] ayat tak."
"1615","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Salam se Qais bin Ubad ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Madina ki masjid mein baitha tha. Phir ek mard dakhil hua jis ke chehre par khushu ka nishan tha. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ye Jannat walon mein se ek mard hai. Phir us ne do rakatein parhein, unhe halki kiya. Phir nikla aur main us ke peechhe chala. Phir main ne kaha: Beshak jab tum masjid mein dakhil hue to unhon ne kaha: Ye Jannat walon mein se ek mard hai. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Kisi ke liye jayez nahi ke wo kahe jo wo nahi janta. Aur main tumhe bayan karunga wo kyun tha. Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein khwab dekha. Phir main ne Aap ko bayan kiya. Aur main ne dekha goya main bagh mein hun [us ki wus'at aur sabze ka zikr kiya], us ke darmiyan lohe ka sutun hai, us ka neeche zameen mein hai aur us ka upar aasman mein hai. Us ke upar kundi hai. Phir us se kaha gaya: Chadho. Main ne kaha: Main taqat nahi rakhta. Phir mere paas khadim aaya. Phir us ne mere kapde peechhe se uthaye. Phir main chadha yahan tak ke us ke upar tha. Phir main ne kundi pakdi. Phir us se kaha gaya: Mazboot pakdo. Phir main bedar hua jabke wo mere hath mein thi. Phir main ne use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bayan kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo bagh Islam hai. Aur wo sutun Islam ka sutun hai. Aur wo kundi mazboot kundi hai. Phir tum Islam par ho yahan tak ke maro. Aur wo mard Abdullah bin Salam hain."
"1616","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hassan bin Thabit se Sa'id bin al-Musayyab ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar masjid mein guzre jabke Hassan sher parh rahe they. To unhon ne kaha: Main us mein sher parhta tha jabke us mein wo tha jo tum se behtar tha. Phir Abu Hurairah ki taraf mutawajjah hue. Phir unhon ne kaha: Main tumhe Allah ki qasam deta hun. Kya tum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Meri taraf se jawab do. Ae Allah! Ruh al-Qudus se us ki taeed farma? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"1617","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hassan se farmaya: Un ki hajw karo ya unhe bura kaho. Aur Jibreel tumhare sath hain."
"1618","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Urwa ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aisha ke paas Hassan ko bura kehne gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Use bura na kaho. Kyunke wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf se difa karta tha."
"1619","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Masrooq ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Aisha ke paas dakhil hue jabke un ke paas Hassan bin Thabit they, unhe sher suna rahe they, un ke chand ash'ar se ishq ka izhar karte hue. Aur farmaya: Paak-daman, danish-mand, tohmat se muttaham nahi. Aur subah bhooki ghaflat wali aurton ke gosht se. Phir Aisha ne us se kaha: Lekin tum aise nahi ho. Masrooq ne kaha: Phir main ne un se kaha: Tum use kyun ijazat detin ho ke wo tumhare paas dakhil ho jabke Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya [aur un mein se jis ne us ka bada hissa uthaya us ke liye bada azab hai]? To unhon ne kaha: Aur andhapan se bada kaun sa azab hai? Unhon ne us se kaha: Beshak wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf se difa, ya hajw karta tha."
"1620","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hassan ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mushrikon ki hajw ki ijazat mangi. Aap ne farmaya: Mere nasab ka kya hoga? To Hassan ne kaha: Main tumhe un se aise nikalunga jaise baal aate se nikala jata hai."
"1621","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak tum dawa karte ho ke Abu Hurairah Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par kasrat se hadith bayan karta hai. Aur Allah se milna hai. Beshak main miskeen shakhs tha. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se apne pet bhar par chipakta tha. Aur Muhajirin unhe bazaron mein khareed-farokht mashghool rakhti thi. Aur Ansar unhe apne maalon ki dekh-bhaal mashghool rakhti thi. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas ek din hazir tha. Aur Aap ne farmaya: Kaun apni chadar bichhaye yahan tak ke main apni baat poori karun? Phir use samețe. Phir wo kuchh nahi bhoolega jo us ne mujh se suna? Phir main ne chadar bichhayi jo mujh par thi. Phir Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke sath bheja! Main kuchh nahi bhoola jo main ne Aap se suna."
"1622","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe bheja, main, Zubair aur Miqdad bin al-Aswad. Unhon ne kaha: Chalo yahan tak ke Raudat Khakh aao. Kyunke us mein aurat hai, us ke paas kitab hai. Phir use us se lo. Phir hum chale. Hamare ghode hamein daudate hue yahan tak ke hum Rauda pahunche. Phir hum aurat se they. Phir hum ne kaha: Kitab nikalo. To us ne kaha: Mere paas kitab mein se kuchh nahi. Phir hum ne kaha: Tum kitab zaroor nikalogi ya hum kapde phenkenge. Phir us ne use apni choti se nikala. Phir hum use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laye. Phir us mein tha: Hatib bin Abi Balta'a ki taraf se, Makkah ke mushrikon mein se kuchh logon ki taraf. Unhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke kuchh mamle ki khabar deta hai. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Hatib! Ye kya hai? Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujh par jaldi na farmayiye. Beshak main Quraish mein lipta hua shakhs tha. Aur un mein se na tha. Aur tumhare sath Muhajirin mein se jo they, Makkah mein un ki rishtedariyan thein jin se wo apne ghar walon aur maalon ki hifazat karte. Phir main ne pasand kiya, jab mujh se un mein nasab ka wo na mila, ke un ke paas hath banaun jis se wo meri rishtedari ki hifazat karein. Aur main ne kufr, irtidad ya Islam ke baad kufr se razaamandi se nahi kiya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak us ne tumhe sach kaha. Phir Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe chhoro ke main is munafiq ki gardan maar dun. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak us ne Badr mein shirkat ki. Aur tumhe kya maloom? Shayad Allah ne Ahle Badr par ittila farmayi ho. Phir farmaya: Jo chaho karo. Phir main ne tumhe bakhsh diya."
"1623","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas tha jabke Wo Ji'rana mein utre they, Makkah aur Madina ke darmiyan. Aur Aap ke sath Bilal they. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dehati aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Kya tum mere liye wo poora nahi karoge jo tum ne mujh se wada kiya? To Aap ne us se farmaya: Khush ho jao. Phir us ne kaha: Tum ne mujh par [khush ho jao] zyada kiya. Phir Aap Abu Musa aur Bilal ki taraf ghazab-naak jaisa mutawajjah hue. Phir farmaya: Us ne khush-khabri radd ki. Phir tum dono qubool karo. Un dono ne kaha: Hum ne qubool kiya. Phir Aap ne pyala mangwaya jis mein pani tha. Phir us mein apne hath aur chehra dhoye. Aur us mein thooka. Phir farmaya: Us mein se piyo. Aur apne chehron aur seenon par dalo. Aur khush ho jao. Phir un dono ne pyala liya. Phir kiya. Phir Umm Salama ne parde ke peechhe se pukara: Apni maan ke liye zyada rakho. Phir unhon ne us ke liye us mein se kuchh zyada rakha."
"1624","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Hunain se farigh hue to Aap ne Abu Amir ko Autas ki taraf lashkar par bheja. Phir wo Duraid bin al-Simma se mile. Phir Duraid qatl hua. Aur Allah ne us ke sathiyon ko shikast di. Abu Musa ne kaha: Aur Aap ne mujhe Abu Amir ke sath bheja. Phir Abu Amir ko us ke ghutne mein mara gaya. Jushami ne use teer mara aur us ke ghutne mein rok diya. Phir main us ke paas pahuncha. Phir main ne kaha: Ae chacha! Tumhe kis ne mara? Phir us ne Abu Musa ki taraf ishara kiya. Phir us ne kaha: Wo mera qatil hai jis ne mujhe mara. Phir main us ki taraf gaya aur use paya. Phir jab us ne mujhe dekha to peeth pher gaya. Phir main us ke peechhe chala. Aur us se kehne laga: Kya tum sharmate nahi? Kya tum sabit nahi rehte? Phir wo ruka. Phir hum ne talwar se do zarbein marein. Phir main ne use qatl kiya. Phir main ne Abu Amir se kaha: Allah ne tumhare sathi ko qatl kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ye teer nikaalo. Phir main ne use nikala. Phir us mein se pani nikla. Unhon ne kaha: Ae bhatije! Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko salam kaho. Aur un se kaho: Mere liye maghfirat mango. Aur Abu Amir ne mujhe logon par khalifa banaya. Phir thodi der thehre. Phir faut ho gaye. Phir main lauta. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas Aap ke ghar mein dakhil hua jabke Wo bunے hue bistar par they. Aur Aap par bichhauna tha jabke bistar ki chatai ne Aap ki peeth aur pehlu mein nishan dal diya tha. Phir main ne Aap ko hamari khabar aur Abu Amir ki khabar di. Aur farmaya: Un se kaho mere liye maghfirat mango. Phir Aap ne pani mangwaya aur wuzu farmaya. Phir apne dono hath uthaye. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Ubaid Abu Amir ko bakhsh de. Aur main ne Aap ki baghalon ki safedi dekhi. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Use Qayamat ke din logon mein se bahut se khalq se upar bana. Phir main ne kaha: Aur mere liye maghfirat mango. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Abdullah bin Qais ke gunah bakhsh de. Aur use Qayamat ke din izzat wali jagah dakhil farma. Abu Burda ne kaha [hadith ke rawi]: Ek Abu Amir ke liye, doosri Abu Musa ke liye."
"1625","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main Ash'ariyon ke qafile ki Quran se awazein raat mein dakhil hote waqt pehchanta hun. Aur raat mein Quran ki awazon se un ke maskan pehchanta hun, agarche main ne un ke maskan na dekhe hon jab wo din mein utre. Aur un mein danish-mand hai. Jab wo ghodon se mile [ya farmaya] dushman se, wo un se kehta hai ke mere sathi tumhe hukm dete hain ke unhe mohlat do."
"1626","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Ash'ari jab ladayi mein mohtaj hon, ya un ke ghar walon ka khana Madina mein kam ho, to jo un ke paas ho ek kapde mein jama karte. Phir use ek bartan mein barabari se taqseem karte. Phir wo mujh se hain aur main un se hun."
"1627","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa aur Asma bint Umais se Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke nikalne ki khabar pahunchi jabke hum Yemen mein they. Phir hum Aap ki taraf hijrat karte nikle, main aur mere do bhai. Main un mein sab se chhota hun. Un mein se ek Abu Burda, doosra Abu Ruhm. Meri qaum mein se tirpan ya bawan mardon mein. Phir hum kashti mein sawar hue. Phir hamari kashti hamein Najashi ke paas Habsha mein le gayi. Phir hum Ja'far bin Abi Talib se mile. Phir hum un ke sath thehre yahan tak ke hum sab aaye. Phir hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mile jab Aap ne Khaibar fatah kiya tha. Aur logon mein se kuchh hum se kehte they [matlab kashti walon se]: Hum tum se hijrat mein sabqat le gaye. Aur Asma bint Umais, jo hamare sath aayein thein, Hafsa zauja Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas mulaqat ke liye dakhil huein, jabke wo Najashi ki taraf hijrat karne walon mein hijrat kar chuki thein. Phir Umar Hafsa ke paas dakhil hue jabke Asma un ke paas thein. Phir Umar ne jab Asma ko dekha to kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Asma bint Umais. Umar ne kaha: Habshiya ye? Samandari ye? Asma ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Hum tum se hijrat mein sabqat le gaye. Phir hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zyada haq-dar hain tum se. Phir wo ghazab-naak huein. Aur farmaya: Hargiz nahi, Allah ki qasam! Tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath they. Wo tumhare bhooke ko khilate, tumhare jahil ko wa'z karte. Aur hum door walon ke ghar mein they, [ya] Habsha mein door dushman wali zameen mein. Aur ye Allah aur Us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mein tha. Allah ki qasam! Main khana nahi khaungi, sharbat nahi piyungi yahan tak ke jo tum ne kaha Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr karun. Aur hum takleef diye jate aur darte they. Aur main isے Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr karungi. Aur Aap se poochhungi. Allah ki qasam! Main jhoot nahi bolungi, na tedhi chalungi, na us par izafa karungi. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye to unhon ne kaha: Ya Nabiullah! Beshak Umar ne aisa aur aisa kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Phir tum ne us se kya kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne us se aisa aur aisa kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Wo tum se mujh se zyada haq-dar nahi. Us ke aur us ke sathiyon ke liye ek hijrat hai. Aur tumhare liye, tum kashti walo ke liye do hijratein hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir beshak main ne Abu Musa aur kashti walon ko dekha ke wo mere paas giroh dar giroh aate, mujh se is hadith ke bare mein poochhte. Duniya mein koi cheez nahi jis se wo zyada khush hon, na un ke dilon mein us se badi, jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya. Abu Burda ne kaha [hadith ke ravi]: Asma ne kaha: Phir beshak main ne Abu Musa ko dekha ke wo mujh se is hadith ko dohrate."
"1628","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye ayat hum mein nazil hui [jab tum mein se do girohon ne irada kiya ke sust hon] Bani Salima aur Bani Haritha. Aur main pasand nahi karta ke wo nazil na hui hoti. Jabke Allah farmata hai [aur Allah un ka dost hai]."
"1629","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam se Anas bin Malik ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main un par ghamgeen hua jo Harra mein musibat mein mubtala hue. Phir mujhe Zaid bin Arqam ne likha, jabke unhe mere sakht gham ki khabar pahunchi, zikr karte hue ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Ae Allah! Ansar ko bakhsh de, Ansar ke beton ko."
"1630","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aurton aur bachchon ko shadi se aate dekha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue, misal banate hue. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Tum mujhe logon mein sab se mehboob ho. Aap ne ye teen martaba farmaya."
"1631","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek aurat Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi jabke us ke sath us ka bachcha tha. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se kalam kiya. Phir farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak tum mujhe logon mein sab se mehboob ho, do martaba."
"1632","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ansar meri kokh aur meri theeley hain. Aur log zyada honge aur kam honge. Phir un ke nek se qubool karo aur un ke bure se darguzar karo."
"1633","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Usaid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ansar ke gharon mein behtar Bani Najjar hain. Phir Bani Abd al-Ashhal. Phir Bani Harith bin Khazraj. Phir Bani Sa'ida. Aur Ansar ke har gharon mein bhalayi hai. Phir Sa'd ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko nahi dekhta magar Aap ne hum par fazilat di hai. Phir kaha gaya: Aap ne tumhe bahut par fazilat di hai."
"1634","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir bin Abdullah se Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Jarir bin Abdullah ke sath raha. Phir wo meri khidmat karte jabke wo Anas se bade they. Jarir ne kaha: Beshak main ne Ansar ko koi cheez karte dekha. Main un mein se kisi ko nahi pata magar us ki izzat karta hun."
"1635","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aslam, Allah use salamti de. Aur Ghifar, Allah use bakhshے."
"1636","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mimbar par farmaya: Ghifar, Allah use bakhshے. Aur Aslam, Allah use salamti de. Aur Usayya, us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki na-farmani ki."
"1637","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Quraish, Ansar, Juhaina, Muzaina, Aslam, Ashja aur Ghifar mere dost hain. Un ka Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke siwa dost nahi."
"1638","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aslam, Ghifar aur Muzaina aur Juhaina mein se kuchh [ya farmaya] Juhaina ya Muzaina mein se kuchh, Allah ke nazdeek behtar hain [ya farmaya] Qayamat ke din, Asad, Tamim, Hawazin aur Ghatfan se."
"1639","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Aqra bin Habis ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha: Tum se to hajiyon ke choron ne bai'at ki, Aslam, Ghifar, Muzaina aur Juhaina mein se. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Batayo, agar Aslam, Ghifar, Muzaina aur Juhaina Bani Tamim, Bani Amir, Asad aur Ghatfan se behtar hon, wo nakam aur khasare mein rahe? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak wo un se behtar hain."
"1640","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Tufail bin Amr al-Dausi aur us ke sathi Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Daus ne na-farmani ki aur inkar kiya. Phir Allah se us par bad-dua farmayiye. Phir kaha gaya: Daus halak hui. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Daus ko hidayat de aur unhe la."
"1641","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Bani Tamim se hamesha mohabbat karta raha jab se teen sune jo main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko un mein farmate suna. Main ne Aap ko farmate suna: Wo Dajjal par meri ummat mein sab se sakht hain. Unhon ne kaha: Aur un ke sadqe aaye. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye hamari qaum ke sadqe hain. Aur un mein se qaidi Aisha ke paas thi. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Use aazad karo. Kyunke wo Aulad Ismail mein se hai."
"1642","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum logon ko kanein paoge. Jahiliyat mein un mein behtar wo hain jo Islam mein behtar hain jab samjhein. Aur is mamle mein logon mein behtar paoge jo use sab se zyada na-pasand kare. Aur logon mein bura paoge do chehron wale ko jo in ke paas ek chehre se aata hai aur un ke paas ek chehre se."
"1643","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Quraish ki aurtein oont par sawar hone wali aurton mein behtar hain. Bachche par sab se narm, shohar par us ke hath mein sab se dekh-bhaal karne wali. Abu Hurairah us ke baad kehte: Aur Maryam bint Imran kabhi oont par sawar nahi huein."
"1644","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Asim ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya tumhe pahuncha hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Islam mein half nahi? To unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Quraish aur Ansar ke darmiyan mere ghar mein muwakhawat farmayi."
"1645","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ek zamana aayega jab logon ka giroh ladega. Phir kaha jayega: Tum mein wo hai jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath raha? Phir kaha jayega: Haan. Phir us par fatah hogi. Phir ek zamana aayega. Phir kaha jayega: Tum mein wo hai jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba ke sath raha? Phir kaha jayega: Haan. Phir fatah hogi. Phir ek zamana aayega. Phir kaha jayega: Tum mein wo hai jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba ke sathi ke sath raha? Phir kaha jayega: Haan. Phir fatah hogi."
"1646","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Logon mein behtar mera zamana hai. Phir jo un se mile hain. Phir jo un se mile hain. Phir qaumein aayengi jin mein se ek ki gawahi us ki qasam se aage badhegi, us ki qasam us ki gawahi se."
"1647","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Tum mein behtar mera zamana hai. Phir jo un se mile hain. Phir jo un se mile hain]. Imran ne kaha: Main nahi janta. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Aap ke baad do zamanon ka zikr farmaya ya teen ka? Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Beshak tumhare baad qaum khayanat karegi aur amanat nahi di jayegi. Aur gawahi denge jabke un se gawahi nahi mangi jayegi. Aur nazr manenge aur poori nahi karenge. Aur un mein motapa zahir hoga]."
"1648","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni zindagi ke aakhir mein hamein Isha parhayi. Phir jab Aap ne salam phera to khade hue. Phir farmaya: [Kya tumhe tumhari ye raat dikhayi? Kyunke sau saal ke sar se us mein se jo zameen ki peeth par hai koi baqi nahi rahega]."
"1649","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Mere sahaba ko gali na do. Phir agar tum mein se ek Uhud jaisa sona kharch kare to un mein se ek ke mudd ko nahi pahunchega, na us ke aadhe ko]."
"1650","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas baithe they. Phir Aap par Surah Juma nazil hui [aur un mein se doosre jo abhi un se nahi mile]. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Wo kaun hain Ya Rasulullah? Phir Aap ne usے jawab na diya, yahan tak ke teen martaba poochha. Aur hum mein Salman Farsi they. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna hath Salman par rakha. Phir farmaya: [Agar iman Surayya ke paas hota to mard [ya] shakhs un mein se use pata]."
"1651","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: [Beshak log sau oonton jaisa hain. Un mein sawari mushkil se paoge]."
"1652","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri achhi sohbat ka sab se haq-dar kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: [Tumhari walida]. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: [Tumhari walida]. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: [Tumhari walida]. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: [Phir tumhara walid]."
